# r1113 pwg5 follow-up on the same running server: /reload with the fixed pwg_p4_probe.js (sourcesOf overload), then zpwg4 check again (SQ-PWG-35 glue half).
pace 2

## SQ-PWG-35b | zpwg4 check after the probe fix: clutch display source, redstone converter, spinning_rotor damage
shell cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/pwg_p4_probe.js kubejs/server_scripts/zz_pwg_p4_probe.js
> reload
sleep 40
> zpwg4 check
waitlog \[zpwg4\] done 30
expect \[zpwg4\] display clutch=true sources on generator_clutch=1$
expect \[zpwg4\] redstone converter clutch=true$
expect \[zpwg4\] damage spinning_rotor msgId=spinning_rotor bypassArmor=false$
reject \[zpwg4\] (error|display error|redstone converter error|damage error)
